Prime Minister **[+ prime_minister +]** still controls the executive and Maciej
Świrski still chairs the National Broadcasting Council. PiS-era managers keep
the public signal while presenters describe the election result as an attack
on the state.

Lewica has votes, lawyers and an audience of its own; it does not have the
company keys. We can map patronage, force a statutory alternative into the
record or stop borrowing distribution from institutions the government owns.

