Three of our deputies are unusually good at this, and the party's whole reach
is reorganised around them: their sittings scheduled for the audience, their
clips pushed, their names on every invitation. Recognition rises faster than
any campaign spending could achieve.

Everyone else in the caucus notices. So does every rival party with a
recruitment budget, because the Left has just published a list of the three
people whose departure would cost it most.

- @poland_event_queue: Back the three performers

