The caucus keeps its schedule. The clips still get made, but they are made by
other people about other deputies, and the accounts that grew fastest during
the pandemic are considerably better at this than we are.

The novelty does fade, as predicted. It fades having introduced several
million people to a set of political personalities, none of whom are ours.

- @poland_event_queue: Let the novelty pass

